    "basis": "B7. OD-7 (owner commission 2026-10-08, ENGINEERING only; not culinary validation, not released guidance). Evidence: private/research/substitution-knowledge (2026-10-07). 1/2 evaporated + 1/2 water by volume: ATK SRC-CM-38#a-c (tested 75/25, 67/33, 50/50 in pudding, sponge cake, bechamel; only 50/50 close to milk); NDSU SRC-CM-29#e, Mississippi State SRC-CM-30#b, Oregon State SRC-CM-31#d, Illinois SRC-CM-32#a. Disagreements kept: Nestle US 1:1 undiluted (SRC-CM-37, refuted by ATK's test); Nestle NZ 1:1.25 water (SRC-CM-39#a, summarizer-only, product-specific). Doughs were not among the tested foods. Engineering bounds: 60-480 ML."
